#
# This file marks the first public baseline of the shop credit ledger
# submitted for the Freedom With AI Batch 10 build project. All must-do
# items, tester hooks and bonus menu items are included. Balances are
# computed from entries only; customer data stays in the browser.
#
# Version 1.1.0.0 adds, beside the baseline and without changing what it does:
# a shop profile (owner, address, logo) shown in the header and on the
# statement; a balance history line on each customer page; more than one shop
# on the same phone, with a switcher and "Import as a new shop". The add-ons
# live in profile.js and shops.js; the ledger itself is unchanged.
#
# Version 1.2.0.0 (22 to 23 November 2026) adds, as add-on files beside the
# ledger: nine more languages (twelve in all), customer page tools (totals, days
# since the last payment, call, WhatsApp chat, change phone, delete with undo),
# note shortcuts, an overdue total and the date the figures are for.
#
# Version 1.2.1.0 (23 November 2026): layout polish for every language and width (polish.css),
# customer names in the nine newer scripts (names.js), and a tappable pay link in the WhatsApp
# reminder (pay.html), because WhatsApp does not make upi:// addresses tappable.
#
# Version 1.2.2.0 (23 November 2026): other ways to send the reminder when WhatsApp refuses a number
# (sendways.js): as an SMS, to a contact chosen in WhatsApp, or copied; a note on sample numbers.
#
# Version 1.2.3.0 (23 November 2026): a WhatsApp check when a customer is added (wacheck.js): a hello
# message to the number, and the owner's answer (chat opened, or refused) remembered per number.
#
# Version 1.2.3.1 (23 November 2026): a wrong answer to the WhatsApp check is switched with one tap.
